    <expertiseList>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/b2a3edc0320545289b8308b47e659819"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/690bbe705c024c9194a1957d1fa8e68e"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/e5c3cd0014b741589806c3ce5728895a"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/b2a3edc0320545289b8308b47e659819","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Soil Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/690bbe705c024c9194a1957d1fa8e68e","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Concrete Strength Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/e5c3cd0014b741589806c3ce5728895a","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Asphalt Verification and Testing"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/68d3b411a8c84ea7a6c52194d3e47316","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/68d3b411a8c84ea7a6c52194d3e47316","content":"\u003cdiv class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"758bl\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInside the new Roadlab Rock Mechanics Unit \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith the facility now fully installed and calibrated, our teams are carrying out initial verification testing to confirm repeatability, accuracy, and consistency across all systems. This early testing phase is critical — ensuring that every result we take to market is backed by proven performance, not assumptions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/4tnb2k2x/rock-laboratory-new-era.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith installation and calibration of the facility now complete, our specialists are conducting structured verification testing to confirm that each instrument is producing consistent, repeatable, and reliable results. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis early testing is essential. Before any external work is undertaken, every method must demonstrate stability and reproducibility under controlled conditions — ensuring that results issued later are defensible, traceable, and fit for purpose. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo support this work, a dedicated soil preparation area has been established within the laboratory.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/24od2plu/rock-prep-laboratory.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis space allows samples to be reduced, conditioned, and brought to specification prior to testing, ensuring that analytical results reflect true material behaviour rather than preparation variability. It also enables more efficient handling of rugged sample types typically encountered in geotechnical and pavement investigations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTogether, these preparations mark the transition of the Rock Mechanics Laboratory from build phase to operational use. By focusing first on internal validation, method discipline, and workflow refinement, Roadlab is ensuring that the facility is client-ready in the truest sense — equipped not only with advanced instrumentation, but with the processes and controls required to deliver dependable insight from day one.design NME applications at a national scale.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBringing Greater Insight to Market in 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith the Rock Mechanics Laboratory now fully complete and calibrated, Roadlab will soon be generating reliable and verifiable data to support major onstruction decisions made in 2026.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIf your projects demand results you can rely on, this is where that work begins.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/ldcp1x4i/xrd-results.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<p>Roadlab’s Rock Mechanics Laboratory has entered operational readiness and is now focused on verification testing to ensure reliable results once we go to market.</p>",
